ami, Florida: Jake Tapper)  Obama's campaign in Florida while he announced he will visit his ailing grandmother, Madelyn Dunham&#134;, in Hawaii featured; scenes shown from his economy roundtable at a Florida college.  [Governor Ted STRICKLAND&nbsp- jokes about Sean, the Iron Worker.]  [OBAMA&nbsp- speaks about taxes; talks about his grandmother's sacrifice.]  \n\n(Studio: Charles Gibson; Washington: George Stephanopoulos)  McCain's attempts to get a blue state in Wisconsin, Pennsylvania or New Hampshire while running out of cash to compete everywhere and the poll findings on first-time voters with the huge advantage for Obama discussed. ", "segment_duration": 470, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63050.0", "legacy_segment_id": 908875, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "NoYfy8NTKb", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-21", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1660, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 908874, "segment_id": "QlRe5uxerG", "segment_broadcast_id": "NoYfy8NTKb", "segment_title": "Economy: Recession, Stocks", "segment_description": "(Studio: Charles Gibson)  Map shown of states in recession shown.  Stock Market Report. ", "segment_duration": 30, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63520.0", "legacy_segment_id": 908876, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "NoYfy8NTKb", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-21", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadca